  "instructions": [
    "Preheat your clay tajine to 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together yogurt, olive oil, beurre-noisette, garlic, ginger, cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the fish to the marinade and mix well to coat.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 2 hours or overnight.",
    "Remove the fish from the marinade and place it in the preheated tajine.",
    "Pour the lemon juice over the fish and cover the tajine with a lid.",
    "Cook for 12 minutes or until the fish is cooked through and flakes easily with a fork.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve immediately."
  ],
